  abilityName: Rite of the Drowning Dark
  abilityDesc: 17 combo massive Water damage on all foes (25% active Pierce on Fire,
    Water types), 100% damage reduction for 4 turns, enormously boosts max HP, enormously
    boosts Atk, Def, Rec relative to max HP for 4 turns, enormously boosts BB gauge
    for 4 turns & raises allies from KO
